    <!-- Glucose suggestions -->
    <string name="sugg_severe_low_title">⚠️ Very low blood sugar</string>
    <string name="sugg_severe_low">Your reading is dangerously low. Treat it now with fast-acting sugar — juice, regular soda, or glucose tablets. Tell someone nearby. Recheck in 15 minutes. If you feel confused, drowsy, or do not improve, seek emergency care immediately (1122).</string>

    <string name="sugg_low_title">🟠 Low blood sugar</string>
    <string name="sugg_low">Your sugar is below target. Take fast-acting sugar now — half a glass of juice, regular soda, or glucose tablets — then recheck after 15 minutes. Repeat if still low. If symptoms get worse or do not improve, contact your doctor.</string>

    <string name="sugg_in_range_title">🎉 Nicely in range</string>
    <string name="sugg_in_range_1">Great work — your reading is in the target range. Keep going with your meals, activity, and medicines as usual. 💚</string>
    <string name="sugg_in_range_2">Well done. This is right where you want to be. Consistency like this is what protects your health long term. 😊</string>
    <string name="sugg_in_range_3">Your sugar is in range — that is a real achievement. Whatever you are doing, keep it up. 🍎</string>

    <string name="sugg_slightly_high_title">🟡 A little high</string>
    <string name="sugg_slightly_high_1">Slightly above target — this happens to everyone. Drink some water 💧, and a short walk can help if you feel up to it. 🚶</string>
    <string name="sugg_slightly_high_2">A bit high right now. Stay hydrated, go easy on sugary food and drinks, and keep taking your medicines as prescribed.</string>
    <string name="sugg_slightly_high_3">This reading is a little above range. Nothing to worry about on its own — keep monitoring and see if it settles.</string>

    <string name="sugg_high_title">🔴 High reading</string>
    <string name="sugg_high">Your sugar is high. Stay calm, drink water, and avoid sugary food. Recheck in a couple of hours. If it stays high, or you feel unwell — very thirsty, nauseated, or short of breath — contact your doctor.</string>

    <string name="sugg_very_high_title">🚨 Very high reading</string>
    <string name="sugg_very_high">This reading is very high. Do not wait — contact your doctor or go to a clinic now, especially if you feel sick, are vomiting, have stomach pain, or are breathing heavily. In an emergency call 1122.</string>

    <string name="sugg_disclaimer">This is general guidance, not a substitute for your doctor\'s advice.</string>

